{"id":"tranquilamente","lemma":"tranquilamente","pos":"adv","rank":4187,"glosses":["calmly; tranquilly"],"ipa":"/tɾanˌkilaˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Esperamos allí tranquilamente.","en":"We waited there quietly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514791","words":[{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"there"},null]},{"text":"Parece que el bebé duerme tranquilamente.","en":"The baby seems to be sleeping soundly.","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},null]},{"text":"El profesor se lavó tranquilamente las manos.","en":"The professor calmly washed his hands.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"professor"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to wash","l":"lavar"},null,{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"hand","l":"mano"}]},{"text":"¿Es que no podemos charlar tranquilamente sobre eso?","en":"Can't we chat calmly about that?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506723","words":[null,null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to chat"},null,{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"implies"]]},{"text":"Ella falleció tranquilamente mientras dormía.","en":"She passed away peacefully in her sleep.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to pass away, die","l":"fallecer"},null,{"g":"while, whilst, as"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"}]}]}